    <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="background: var(--tn-bg-primary);"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-14 md:mb-18" data-gsap-section-header><div class="tn-section-tag" data-gsap="fade-up"><svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" /></svg>FAQ</div><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] font-extrabold mb-4 leading-[1.15] tracking-tight" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);" data-gsap="fade-up">Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mx-auto" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);" data-gsap="fade-up">TranslateNow hakkında bilmeniz gereken her şey — özellikler, fiyatlandırma, gizlilik ve iOS entegrasyonu.</p></div>
      <div class="space-y-2.5" data-gsap-faq-list>{FAQ_ITEMS.map((faq) => (<div class="tn-faq-item rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--tn-bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);" data-gsap="fade-up"><button class="tn-faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.02]"><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-semibold pr-4 leading-snug" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">{faq.q}</h3><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] flex-shrink-0 tn-faq-chevron" style="color: var(--tn-coral-fire);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></button><div class="tn-faq-content"><div class="px-5 pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);">{faq.a}</p></div></div></div>))}</div></div></section>

    <!-- E-E-A-T -->
    <section class="py-16 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="background: var(--tn-bg-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center" data-gsap="fade-up"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">Coachie AI Tarafından Geliştirildi</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);">TranslateNow, YZ destekli iOS ve Android uygulamaları konusunda uzmanlaşmış bir mobil geliştirme stüdyosu olan Coachie AI tarafından geliştirilmektedir. Ekibimiz App Store ve Google Play'de birden fazla uygulama yayınlamıştır. Cihaz üstü makine öğrenmesi, bulut YZ hizmetleri (OpenAI GPT-4o, ElevenLabs) ve derin platform entegrasyonunu (ARKit, Siri, WidgetKit, Live Activities, Jetpack Compose, ML Kit) birleştirerek gerçek iletişim sorunlarını çözen araçlar geliştiriyoruz.</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Sorularınız veya iş birliği teklifleriniz mi var? Bize ulaşın:<a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-soft-coral);">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a></p></div></section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden" id="download" style="background: var(--tn-bg-primary);" data-gsap-final-cta><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[700px] pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,107,74,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);" data-gsap-cta-glow></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,107,74,0.2), transparent);"></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto relative z-10"><Image src={translateIcon} alt="TranslateNow uygulama simgesi" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl mx-auto mb-8" style="box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255,107,74,0.2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);" width={192} height={192} data-gsap-cta-icon /><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-5 leading-tight tracking-tight" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">Bugün her dili konuşmaya başlayın</h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tn-text-secondary);">TranslateNow'u App Store'dan ücretsiz indirin. Ses klonlama, AR çeviri, belgeler, yazım araçları, çevrimdışı ve 135+ dil.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4" data-gsap-cta-btn><a href={APP_STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="tn-coral-btn tn-coral-btn-large">Ücretsiz İndirin<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg></a></div></div></section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="py-10 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="background: var(--tn-bg-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);" data-gsap-footer><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center md:text-left"><a href="/translate-now" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 no-underline group"><Image src={translateIcon} alt="TranslateNow simgesi" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl object-cover" style="box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" width={96} height={96} /><div><span class="font-bold text-sm block" style="color: var(--tn-text-primary); font-family: var(--font-display);">TranslateNow</span><span class="text-xs" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Coachie AI'dan</span></div></a><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs flex-wrap justify-center" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);"><a href={PRIVACY_URL} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Gizlilik Politikası</a><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={TERMS_URL} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Kullanım Koşulları</a><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">Destek</a>{LANGUAGE_LINKS.map((link) => (<><span style="color: var(--tn-bg-border-subtle);">·</span><a href={link.href} class="hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">{link.label}</a></>))}</div><div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-end gap-1"><a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="text-xs hover:underline transition-colors hover:text-white/60" style="color: var(--tn-text-muted);">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--tn-text-hint);">Son güncelleme: Mart 2026</span></div></div></footer>
  </main>

  <!-- FAQ Override -->
  <style is:inline>
    .tn-faq-content { height: auto !important; max-height: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; transition: max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), opacity 0.3s ease !important; opacity: 0 !important; }
    .tn-faq-item.faq-active .tn-faq-content { max-height: 2000px !important; opacity: 1 !important; }
    .tn-faq-item.faq-active .tn-faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  </style>
  <script is:inline>
    window.addEventListener('load', function() {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-content').forEach(function(c) { c.style.removeProperty('height'); c.style.removeProperty('overflow'); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-btn').forEach(function(oldBtn) {
        var newBtn = oldBtn.cloneNode(true); oldBtn.parentNode.replaceChild(newBtn, oldBtn);
        newBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
          e.preventDefault(); e.stopPropagation();
          var item = newBtn.closest('.tn-faq-item'); if (!item) return;
          var wasActive = item.classList.contains('faq-active');
          document.querySelectorAll('.tn-faq-item').forEach(function(el) { el.classList.remove('faq-active', 'open', 'is-open'); var content = el.querySelector('.tn-faq-content'); if (content) { content.style.removeProperty('height'); content.style.removeProperty('overflow'); } });
          if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('faq-active');
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</TranslateNowLayout>